; The #26 headline: locate the square's centre by meeting two marked
; diagonals. Under the material-layer model the marks do NOT subdivide the
; working sheet (it stays one face while .ctr is located); they graduate to
; F creases only at emit, so the crease pattern still shows the construction.
paper square
mark --ac = through .a .c
mark --bd = through .b .d
.ctr = --ac * --bd
